// A stateful local firing block next to ordinary local transforms must not be
// flattened into a stateless one-shot firing block: the multi-block local
// backend cannot emit a Table transition here, so it reports the owned state.
// ERR: ACLOWER-QUEUE-CXX: mixed nested module supports only stateless local firing blocks; firing block 'thread0' owns Table state
